OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry at   
OL,6,Ffirst on Friday but rain arriving into 
OL,7,Fthe far west by midday. Further        
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain and an increasing    
OL,9,Fwind through Saturday. Becoming dry by 
OL,10,FSunday with sunshine.                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
